From ddf01c70053249135935144bab5cba23493b97dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:18:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Backend: identity-provider boundary, session expiry/logout,
 explicit org selection

- IdentityProvider interface; signup/login use the provider-verified email, never the body
- DevIdentityProvider refuses to run in production; production start is blocked until a real provider exists
- POST /auth/login (no account enumeration) and /auth/logout (revokes current session only)
- sessions always expire (SESSION_TTL_SECONDS); migration 0003 makes expires_at NOT NULL
- replace memberships[0] with X-Organization-Id selection; ambiguous multi-org requests get 400
- Store gains createMembership/createSession/revokeSession
- tests for expiry, logout, multi-org role selection, provider substitution
